---
description: Revisit reviewer concerns before and after every experiment milestone.
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the reviewer-guided experiment rules in the repository root `AGENTS.md`.
Before advancing an experiment, read `revision/REVIEW_TRACKER.md`,
`revision/review_tracker.json`, and its protocol. After the milestone, update
only the concern statuses justified by evidence, recording remaining gaps.
A completed run alone does not resolve a reviewer concern.
